# License & weights-access notes (design-stage reference)

All weights access is documented here so that an executor can verify before running. No code or data are downloaded in this design-only stage.

## Model families

| Family | Component | Repo / source | License / terms | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| LLaMA-2 | base + chat (7B/13B/70B) | `meta-llama/Llama-2-{7b,13b,70b}{,-hf}`, `-chat-hf` mirrors | **Llama-2 Community License** | Requires accepted Meta license on HF. Restricts commercial use above 700M MAU; research use permitted. Hash + commit to be locked at execution (see `reproducibility/environment_lock.md`). |
| Pythia | base (1B/6.9B/12B), step 143000 | `EleutherAI/pythia-{1b,6.9b,12b}` | **Apache-2.0** | Step is fixed per design; intermediate steps not used. |
| LLaMA-1 | 65B base | `huggyllama/llama-65b` | **Non-commercial research only** (Meta release terms). | Used as anchor only; not for any production path. |
| Local judges (optional) | `prometheus-2-8x7b-instruct`, `llama-3-70b-instruct` | per their respective repos | per their respective repos | All weights to be locked at execution. |

