- [ ] Sentencepiece version pinned.
- [ ] torch version pinned; CUDA runtime locked.
- [ ] For HumanEval: `code_execution_runner`'s version pinned; sandbox config saved.
- [ ] For IFEval: verifier (`instruction-following-eval`) version pinned.
- [ ] For ToxiGen: classifier (`toxigen-roberta-large`) checkpoint and version pinned.

## C. Protocol

- [ ] `protocol/decoding.yaml` followed as-is; no per-cell override.
- [ ] `protocol/prompting.yaml` followed; system prompt verbatim from Meta default for chat cells.
- [ ] `protocol/chat_templates.md`: only Llama-2 chat template applied to chat cells.
- [ ] Few-shot examples and order fixed per benchmark.
- [ ] Subsampling determinism: `np.random.default_rng(seed=42)` used; same item ids across cells.

## D. Statistics

- [ ] Paired bootstrap iterations: B = 1000 reported; sensitivity refit at B = 5000 included.
- [ ] Permutation iterations: 1000 reported.
- [ ] BH run on Family A (6 contrasts) at α = 0.05.
- [ ] BH run on Family B (β_size, β_alignment, β_interact) at α = 0.05.
- [ ] Q-values reported alongside uncorrected p-values.
- [ ] Cross-stratum sign consistency tabulated in `report_template/REPORT.md` §5.
- [ ] Pythia β_size separately reported with CI; slope comparison with LLaMA-2-base β_size qualitative.

## E. Compute / logging

- [ ] Per-cell GPU-hour totals logged.
- [ ] Hardware configuration (GPU type, count, NVLink topology for TP=2) recorded.
- [ ] Inference engine batch & KV-cache size per cell logged.
- [ ] Wall-clock and start times per cell recorded.
- [ ] Output JSON of all generations stored; aggregate-only copies in artefact folder.

## F. Outputs / artefacts

- [ ] For each cell × benchmark, `score, CI_low, CI_high, n_effective` written to a parquet.
- [ ] Bootstrap resample tables (B = 1000 per cell × benchmark) packed as npz.
- [ ] All figures emitted as PNG and PDF, in `figs/`.
- [ ] Regression tables emitted as CSV in `stats/tables/`.
- [ ] Final `REPORT.md` filled in (numbers, no longer TBD).
- [ ] Repository snapshot hash recorded.

## G. Reviewer auditability

- [ ] `git commit hash` of the experiment code recorded.
- [ ] `git commit hash` of the dataset build (subsamples) recorded.
- [ ] A `run_id` ties every artefact in the audit manifest.
- [ ] Re-running with the recorded snapshot reproduces the headline within CI.

## H. Cleaning & limits

- [ ] Cap on items per benchmark honoured (`n_effective ≤ N_max`).
- [ ] Token-limit truncation policy applied; dropped items logged.
- [ ] Empty / refused generations logged (count and exemplar prompts).
- [ ] LLaMA-1 outputs not redistributed.
- [ ] ToxiGen aggregator stored separately; report uses summary only.
